{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/alena-leena/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"3e9f0235-d32c-5661-baa0-bbc2f7f82c80","strapi_id":34,"ShortDescription":"Alena Leena is for the modern romantic - luxurious fabrics, delicate details, and effortless silhouettes. Timeless elegance with a fresh, chic edge. ","PriceRangeLow":"275000","PriceRangeHigh":"562500","Name":"ALENA LEENA","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"Ethereal, creative, and truly romantic. Founded by designer Alyona Kostyk, Alena Leena Bridal Seamlessly bridges continents - designed in the vibrant cultural landscape of Cape Town and expertly crafted by a masterful team in Ukraine. Each gown is made-to-order with thoughtful customizations, using luxurious Italian satins and silks for an undeniably elevated feel. "}]},{"children":[{"text":"Inspired by the mysticism and symbolism of flowers, every dress carries the name and essence of a unique bloom - evoking grace, emotion, and the natural poetry of femininity. For the bride who loves artistry, softness, and a touch of magic. "}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/6954d/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.jpg","srcSet":"/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/4a2db/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.jpg 360w,\n/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/e11cb/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.jpg 720w,\n/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/6954d/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.jpg 1440w","sizes":"(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/25534/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.webp 360w,\n/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/52cac/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.webp 720w,\n/static/8efc954256f4b6efbfabaa26a68a15a0/a63f8/alenaleena_desktop_da1de86c13.webp 1440w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: